C1: The new RemoteMsalAuthenticationStartup token endpoint changes the observed result of NavigateDirectlyToLoginCallbackRestartsLoginWithoutInteropFailure because that browser scenario completes an exchange through this endpoint before its assertions. The concern is the asserted browser-test effect, not an independent endpoint policy claim.
